uch  suffering and hatred for slavery it  cannot be settled in one day  for years Caribbean countries have been  seeing any settlement must include  Financial reparations from former  colonizers including Britain and France  quite literally these European states  are founded in large part on the slave  trade  um the naval and political power that  came from the slave trade and on  Imperial rivalry countries like the  Netherlands have tried to avoid the  question of reparations coming from  former colonies like Suriname the debate  is controversial even as Dutch attitudes  to history change this year King Willem  Alexander said Royals will no longer use  a golden Carriage featuring images of  slavery there are calls that he  apologized to but it has to be an  apology that doesn't come with the whiff  of avoidance  of deeper issues for now the Dutch  government has promised funding to  awareness projects and the slavery  Museum Redmond Shannon Global News  London  that is global national for this Monday  I'm Sophie Louis tonight's your Canada  is the ring art installation in Montreal  it's 30 meters in diameter and weighs a  hefty 23 000 kilos or 50 000 pounds  thanks for watching and have yourselves  a great night  [Music]
 

